{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every collection is a copy-on-write struct with the API shape of the standard library’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collections and Swift Collections. Where a structure is a tree or a graph, it also converts to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Grafluent type of that shape ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryTree"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Arborescence"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree"},{"type":"text","text":"), so Grafluent’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms and drawings run over it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"import GrafluentCollections","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" imports every module. Each module also has its own documentation and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be imported on its own. No structure has landed yet; ","type":"text"},{"code":"Greetings","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the template’s placeholder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import GrafluentCollections","","let greeting = Greeting(name: \"Ada\").formal().punctuated(with: \"!\")","print(greeting.text)  \/\/ Good day, Ada!"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"GrafluentCollections"}],"role":"collection","externalID":"GrafluentCollections","symbolKind":"module","title":"GrafluentCollections"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Graph-shaped collections for Swift: search trees, tries, suffix structures and decision diagrams"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with value semantics, built on Grafluent."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GrafluentC